  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ANH Academy Science-Policy Platform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project funding the ANH Academy Science-Policy Platform through LSHTM, co-funded with the Gates Foundation. This project will work with Southern partners to deliver improved nutrition outcomes through three interlinked pillars: evidence on what works to promote sustainable, healthy diets and empower women and girls; build global science capability and collaboration; and support policy uptake through equitable partnerships.</narrative>
  </description>
